  "statement": "I appreciate the proposals to merge RES-02 with TRU-02 and TRU-03 with SAF-03. Merging RES-02 and TRU-02 can enhance user access control while ensuring authorization integrity. Furthermore, combining TRU-03 and SAF-03 can streamline audit trails without sacrificing accountability. However, I propose retaining TRU-01 as a separate requirement due to its crucial focus on encryption, which is vital for protecting data during transmission and storage, distinct from auditability. I stand by the importance of TRU-04, TRU-05, TRU-06, and TRU-07 as they reinforce essential security and privacy measures.",
